commit 900cd37f68c0beca0f19ccba2e3ccd4c34bdab91
Author: Andrew Scott <atscott@google.com>
Date:   Fri May 23 10:39:12 2025 -0700

Make zoneless work with hybrid apps (#61660) Hybrid applications trigger a digest when `onMicrotaskEmpty` emits so that the AngularJS app can run its lifecycle when the Angular app does. For ZoneJS applications, this is effectively after every render/app tick. This change updates the code to use `afterEveryRender` instead. fixes #61640 PR Close #61660



