properly resolve tsconfig paths on windows (#58137) The Angular CLI devkit and Tsurge, as well as TypeScript only deal with Posix paths. We also normalize paths into posix paths, and try to implement a devkit compatible virtual file system for the compiler-cli. This commit fixes an issue where we accidentally resolved `/` to the system root on Windows. e.g. `C:/`. This broke the posix and devkit paths throughout tsconfig parsing. This commit fixes this. Fixes #58132. PR Close #58137



