commit bfbb30618b3204dc62f9fc36b82b98f307f1a6a2
Author: Paul Gschwendtner <paulgschwendtner@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Feb 6 14:06:49 2024 +0000

do not error due to multiple components named equally (#54273) Currently, when two components are named `TestComponent`, and both would use e.g. control flow. Templates would be generated by the compiler and those would conflict at runtime because the names for the template functions are not ensured to be unique. This seems like a more general problem that could be tackled in the future in the template pipeline by always using the `ConstantPool`, but for now, we should be good already, given us ensuring the `baseName`'s are always unique. PR Close #54273



