commit b558f9915068b358d2654d41c1cd92cc0dcc6d74
Author: Andrew Scott <atscott@google.com>
Date:   Mon Jul 29 09:30:34 2024 -0700

Update callback schedulers to cancel pending timers (#57186) Rather than leaving the timers around as no-ops, this commit updates the logic to also attempt to clear or cancel the timers. This is helpful for the eventual goal of running the scheduler in the `fakeAsync` zone (if the test is running in `fakeAsync`) rather than scheduling in the root zone and making it impossible to flush. PR Close #57186



